WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:10.526
This is Deslop running on the Express repository in VS Code. It found every duplicate across a hundred and forty two files and ranked them, worst first.

00:11.783 --> 00:17.790
Open the worst cluster to see every copy and where it lives. One copy is marked as the one to keep.

00:22.317 --> 00:31.510
Compare any copy with it side by side, then refactor with confidence. Install Deslop for VS Code and run it on your own repository.
